  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 9.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et custodiant omnes monetam, sicut vos docere praecipio et omnes elegimus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the coinage is to be maintained by all at the standard which I lay down in your instructions, in accordance with the decision at which we have all arrived.</ab>
      </div>
